1
00:00:00,875 --> 00:00:02,875
Redmond will destroy you.

2
00:00:02,875 --> 00:00:06,208
I only came here
today out of pity, Severin.

3
00:00:06,916 --> 00:00:08,666
I wanted to give
you a way out.

4
00:00:08,666 --> 00:00:09,958
Save it.

5
00:00:09,958 --> 00:00:11,500
I'm not ending the engagement.

6
00:00:12,125 --> 00:00:15,500
I'd love to see how you plan to make me regret it.

7
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:18,875
Don't come crying to me.

8
00:00:19,208 --> 00:00:20,000
Whatever.

9
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,291
Now get out of my house.

10
00:00:21,291 --> 00:00:22,125
Fine!

11
00:00:22,125 --> 00:00:23,416
Then we do the wedding.

12
00:00:23,416 --> 00:00:26,583
I'll make sure the entire city watches you crawl

13
00:00:26,583 --> 00:00:28,875
on your knees and
beg me for mercy!

14
00:00:39,125 --> 00:00:40,208
Damn it!

15
00:00:41,291 --> 00:00:43,250
No one on
this entire continent has

16
00:00:43,250 --> 00:00:45,333
ever made me
regret a damn thing.

17
00:00:45,333 --> 00:00:47,333
Let's see what you've got.

18
00:00:47,625 --> 00:00:48,666
Cassia.

19
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:08,750
My lord.

20
00:01:09,625 --> 00:01:11,958
Three days from now
I will hold my wedding.

21
00:01:13,625 --> 00:01:16,458
Send words to every major power cross Golantis.

22
00:01:16,458 --> 00:01:18,291
I want them all
in attendance.

23
00:01:18,541 --> 00:01:20,458
The one the Sovereign Sanctum

24
00:01:20,458 --> 00:01:22,250
signed with the Scott family,

25
00:01:24,458 --> 00:01:26,583
have it
read aloud at the wedding.

26
00:01:27,333 --> 00:01:28,791
As you command, my lord.

27
00:01:28,791 --> 00:01:30,791
Every name that
matters will be there.

28
00:01:42,958 --> 00:01:43,708
Severin,

29
00:01:43,708 --> 00:01:46,125
we need to come
back to House Carter now!

30
00:01:46,125 --> 00:01:47,791
Your father's dying.
